{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50285","headline":"冬出敦煌郡入退浑国朝发马圈之作 · 佚名","name":"冬出敦煌郡入退浑国朝发马圈之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西行过马圈，北望近阳关。\n回首见城郭，黯然林树间。\n野烟暝村墅，初是惨寒山。\n步步鍼（缄）愁色，迢迢惟梦还。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50285.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50285","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}